		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_569300839163876152">
		Was the collectibles AI generated?	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_569300839163876152">
		Something about the color and artificing is very familiar with AI art. Specifically talking about the stickman drawings you can pick up in the field. No hate for generative AI usage, but if it was AI, the fair thing to do is put up a disclaimer about it	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
