								<div class="forum_topic_name" title="This demo is a lot. There are good mechanics, a hint of an interesting story. The music is great. Its not sad so much as wistful. Maybe grieving. Even the skull demonstrating the points or whatever currency is interesting. Its not a terrifying skull, but a skull that demonstrates more of a regret. I'm looking forward to seeing what happens in the full release.">
